1
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:11,799
Oops, damn—I totally forgot.
I haven't cleared the stuff in my trunk yet.

2
00:00:11,799 --> 00:00:15,390
Why didn't you clear it first then?

3
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:19,691
'Cause BB wouldn't
come help me clean it up.

4
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:25,120
Fine, you clean up here. I'll go help P'Chon first.

5
00:00:36,067 --> 00:00:38,600
Come visit me sometimes, okay?

6
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:39,954
Okay.

7
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:47,180
Oh—here, let me help.

8
00:00:54,720 --> 00:00:57,070
What are you doing—hey!

9
00:00:57,070 --> 00:00:59,831
Take it easy, Earth.

10
00:00:59,831 --> 00:01:03,065
There's nothing going on, P'Gun.

11
00:01:03,391 --> 00:01:07,010
You might not mean anything…
but someone else might.

12
00:01:09,094 --> 00:01:15,525
Uh—P'Chon, thanks for helping me.
My brother's here now.

13
00:01:17,119 --> 00:01:25,759
Thanks for helping. Please, go ahead.
Earth, let's go. This stuff's not even heavy.

14
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:29,196
P'Gun—what are you doing?
